WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.270
It's been a week, hasn't it?

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.290
January 7th 08:13 Cafe Broccolo

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:09.270
Since that Z/X showed up... 
Audium, was it?

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.300
Cafe Broccolo Owner
Mr. Maru

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.010
We've been looking for it all this time, 
but we can't find any leads.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.530
Asuka Tennoji

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.060
Huh? Ayase's not here yet?

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.930
The Proud  Fierte

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.930
Chitose Aoba

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.240
Ayase sent me a message.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.120
She won't be able to participate 
in the search today.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:25.190
Sera Kurashiki        Katana Samurai  Rindo

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.550
Sword Sniper  Rigel

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.550
Azumi Kagamihara

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.920
She came yesterday after we closed.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.050
She wanted some cream puffs, 
so I made some for her.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.420
She said they were a present for someone.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.440
January 7th 09:15 Southwest Nara Prefecture
Village in the Mountains

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.020
I'm sorry I'm late, Dad, Mom.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.570
I brought the cream puffs that Mom loved.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:52.070
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.070
Will you forgive me now?

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:32.960
January 7th 10:02 Southwest Nara Prefecture
Village in the Mountains

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:34.040
Pretty sad-looking village.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.050
Not so much as a cat in sight.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.050
Black Blade  Sieger

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:41.340
Well, with the Black Point this 
close, I'm sure all the humans

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.140
ran off a long time ago.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.180
I wish that were the case.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.310
The people of this village didn't run away.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.110
They were massacred by the angels.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.530
All of them but me.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.690
What?

00:02:57.690 --> 00:02:59.450
You never told me about this.

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:03.200
Three years ago, in this village,

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:06.160
I met a Z/X for the first time in my life.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.910
This is where my revenge began.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.920
My dad was an archaeologist.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:18.800
He used to come here for digs, 
and he'd bring my mom and me.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.800
Ayase's Dad

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.180
There was nothing here, but it was fun.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.180
Ayase's Mom

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:35.060
My mom was nice, and my 
dad was always smiling.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.530
I didn't know it then,

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.490
but I'm sure that was what they call happiness.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.830
Even after that day when 
the Black Point appeared,

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.750
this village was still relatively peaceful.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.750
But the end came suddenly.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.840
It's been three years since then.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:05.510
Today, January 7th, is the day my parents died.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:10.390
It's rare for you to talk about the past.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.580
Since I'm making you help with my revenge,

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.650
I should tell you why I seek it, right?

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.610
You should've told me sooner, then.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.140
January 7th 11:33 Kamiyugi Family Cottage

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.940
Nothing's changed here.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.160
It's as though Mom and Dad 
were living here until yesterday.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.690
Sorry to interrupt your reverie,

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.300
but we've got company.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.220
A Z/X!

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.680
Yeah, and a White World one, too!

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.880
You're no angel!

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.270
Are you one of those Guardians?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.520
Stop your attack, Black World Predator!

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:01.400
I have no intention of fighting!

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:05.610
Maybe you don't, but I do!

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:13.370
Make this Predator stop his 
attacks, Ayase Kamiyugi!

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.090
How do you know my name?

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:19.210
Don't you remember me?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.770
Quit blabbering already!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:26.800
Stop it!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.930
Misaki, I told you to stay hidden.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.270
Misaki Yuzuriha

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.600
But Gar, you were...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.310
Yeah, you saved me.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.390
Thanks.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.190
Ayase, I'll ask you again.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.860
Don't you remember me?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.190
You're...

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.450
My name is Garmatha.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:48.410
Summit of Order  Sir Garmatha

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:50.200
I once led the Guardians 
beneath the Twelve Disciples.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:03.960
<i>That's right.</i>

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:09.970
<i>He's the one who saved 
me from this village.</i>

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.970
January 7th 16:35 Kamiyugi Family Cottage

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:16.230
So you saved Ayase, huh?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.480
Even though you were the one 
who attacked this village?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.520
Stop it, Sieger.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:25.180
He saved my life, for what it's worth.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:30.490
Why did the White Angels 
attack this village, anyway?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.560
They don't go around killing 
humans for no reason

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.350
in the White World, do they?

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:40.460
Gar, if you don't want to talk 
about it, you don't have to.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.880
No, talk.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.250
I want to know, too.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:48.690
At first, it was merely an accident.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.140
O-Oh, no!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.350
Well, this is a problem.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.270
I'm sorry.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.030
Do you really get it?

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.940
We're supposed to lead humans.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.610
We are not to hurt them, 
even if it's an accident.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.990
Yes, I'm aware.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.540
I'll ensure he is dealt with harshly.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.870
You don't get it. He's not the one 
who needs to be dealt with.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.290
Angels are very concerned 
with appearances.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:29.630
So you did that to hide the accident?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.070
If you kill everybody who 
knew about the accident,

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:36.260
you can pretend it never happened?

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:41.100
But that wouldn't hide the fact 
that a whole village disappeared.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.770
But nobody would know who did it.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.200
I see.

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:48.900
So it might've been a 
Z/X from another world.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:52.880
And you say you guys are 
supposed to lead humans?

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.820
You guys are as nasty as 
they come, aren't you?

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:59.290
Stop it! Gar opposed it all along!

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.290
What do you mean?

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:10.300
Please stop this!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:14.510
Attacking innocent people is unforgivable.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:20.430
Oh, so you won't do what I tell you, then?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:24.440
And you're supposed to be 
the leader of the Guardians.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.940
I'll have to punish you.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.190
12 Disciples  Aquarius Gambiel

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.190
If you get it, then go finish them!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.660
Mom! Dad! Wake up!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.160
Dad! Mom!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:38.660
No!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.240
No!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:41.830
Don't die!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.160
Mom! Mom!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.670
No!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.480
There's still one alive?

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.690
Okay, let's finish he—

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:37.010
This warmth must never be lost.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.720
That's what I thought in that moment.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:44.730
And the next thing I knew, 
I was running with her in my arms.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.950
Student ID

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.950
Ayase Kamiyugi...

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.960
This is all I can do for you.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.460
I'm sorry.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:17.470
That's right.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:21.470
When I woke up, I was in a small 
train station in the mountains.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.410
What did you do after that?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:29.480
Since I'd betrayed my companions, 
I couldn't return to my own world.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.200
And they were pursuing me,

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.980
so I couldn't even get 
close to the Black Point.

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:38.820
I lost my resources, and all I 
could do was wait for the end.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:47.000
You'll get soaked.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:56.170
A girl dressed like a shrine 
priestess gave me a Card Device,

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.510
and I used it to capture Gar.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:03.740
Thanks to Misaki, I can still exist in this world.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:08.900
Every January 7th since then, 
he's come to this village.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.520
I told him it's dangerous 
since it's so close to

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.650
the White World's Black Point,
but he won't stop.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.530
I see... But...

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:21.340
I still can't believe Misaki 
Yuzuriha is a Z/X user.

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:32.000
<b>Misaki</b>

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:32.000
I'm lost inside you.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:36.210
January 7th 18:47 Kobe

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.000
I sneezed all over Misaki!

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.260
Thank you!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.260
And I'm already strapped this month...

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.770
<i>Can you hear me, Rigel?</i>

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.600
What is it, Administrator Polaris?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.980
Administrator  Polaris

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.480
<i>Azumi should be out of medicine by now.</i>

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.280
<i>You're ordered to temporarily 
return to base to refill it.</i>

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.030
Understood.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:01.030
I'll bring her immediately.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.570
<i>No, I want you to come alone this time.</i>

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.830
Just me?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:08.670
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:11.710
<i>We don't know when her next attack will occur.</i>

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:15.000
<i>It'll take longer if she comes with you.</i>

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.340
Azumi...

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.170
I'll be fine.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.430
Hey!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.180
Are you going somewhere, Rigel?

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:29.180
Yes.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.390
I'll be back, Azumi.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.120
Okay.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:42.940
Ayase, what did you do after that?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.880
I lived with my grandmother 
at my dad's old house.

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:56.600
My family was very wealthy, 
so I didn't want for anything.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:59.210
I was able to return to a peaceful lifestyle.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.220
I started going to school,

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.470
and I even made friends.

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:13.520
But sometimes I would remember...

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:23.160
the happy days that I'd lost forever.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:36.550
So when my grandmother died and 
I was left all alone, I decided...

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.760
that I would take revenge on the angels

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.810
who'd taken the people I loved.

00:13:56.510 --> 00:14:00.600
But I needed the help of 
a Z/X to defeat the Z/X.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:05.640
And when I learned that the 
only way for a human to use

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.320
a Z/X is a Card Device,

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:12.700
I went to Tokyo, where underground 
trades of devices took place.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:16.040
November 17th 15:56 Tokyo
Several Years Ago

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.790
That wasn't the deal!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.420
Y-You said I could have a Card Device 
if I brought you 3 million yen.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.550
Sorry, little girl.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.430
That price was only effective until yesterday.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.720
Have you heard of "supply and demand"?

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.940
Well, have a seat.

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.030
It'll be 2 million more.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:49.860
And if you don't pay today, 
it'll go up even more.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:53.950
What?!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.080
No wonder it smelled so good.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.130
There's a young girl here.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.710
Damn, a Z/X!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.340
Take this! Capture!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.760
It's defective?!

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.180
Idiot.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:32.450
You need the right stuff to use that thing.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.330
Must be tough being so ignorant.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.490
Now then...

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.250
Time for the main dish.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:51.260
Whoa there, girl, didn't you hear me?

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.890
You need the...

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.470
C-Capture!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.220
What?

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.240
I-I did it.

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.750
Now you've done it, girl.

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:33.680
I'll give you an especially 
brutal death as a reward.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:34.800
Wait!

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.580
If you want to kill me, then kill me.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:43.490
But give me a little time.

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.900
What are you talking about?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:52.780
There's somebody I have to take 
revenge on, no matter what!

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:55.510
Revenge?

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:02.390
So you're prepared to die, then.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:03.760
Who is it?

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:06.880
The angels.

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:08.920
The angels?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.730
What's so funny?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.430
A mere human taking 
revenge on the angels?

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.060
How could I not laugh?

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.450
I know...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:27.770
I know it's reckless and crazy, 
but that's why I came here to...

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:30.630
I'm in.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:35.290
Even I haven't killed an angel yet.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.320
So why not?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.490
I'll hunt your angels for you.

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.840
You never told me your name.

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.440
Ayase Kamiyugi.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.340
My name is Sieger.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.350
Listen, don't forget our promise.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.290
Your life is mine.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:05.620
Yes.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.730
Once my revenge is over, 
you can do as you please.

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.620
Hey, you okay?

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:34.510
Yes, don't worry about me.

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.550
Let's find the next angel.

00:18:56.050 --> 00:19:02.410
From then on, we killed many angels 
in our quest for revenge.

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:21.050
That's horrible.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:24.850
Gar...

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:29.880
Gar didn't save you so you could do that!

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:34.250
He didn't save you so you could do that!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:39.030
Then why did he save me?

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:42.240
Ayase, forgive my selfishness.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:48.690
But I wanted you to live 
looking ahead to tomorrow.

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.270
Then give them back.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:20:00.010
Give back my mom and dad, 
and all the precious time I lost.

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.480
Who was it who took them from me?

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:13.540
You were the ones who took them from me!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.530
I'm sorry.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:36.920
My hands are already stained 
with the blood of angels.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.650
I can't give up on my revenge now.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:48.640
So we didn't find anything 
else on Audium today, either?

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:47.890
January 7th 21:12 Cafe Broccolo

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.430
I can't walk anymore.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:54.100
Maybe those resource detectors don't work.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.440
Are you complaining about my plan,

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.570
Mikado Kurosaki

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.570
Asuka Tennoji?

00:20:58.560 --> 00:20:59.600
Mikado!

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.440
What are you doing here?

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.820
I wanted to confirm something.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.820
Depending on the answer, 
I may be forced to destroy Kobe.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.070
Wh-What?!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:14.000
January 8th 05:57 Southwest Nara Prefecture
Village in the Mountains

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.000
Tell me one thing.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:20.750
The angel who ordered that 
my mom and dad be killed...

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.930
What was its name?

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.670
Tell me.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:31.430
You saved me from that hell, 
so you have that responsibility.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:38.480
Aquarius Gambiel of the Twelve Disciples.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.280
Gambiel...

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:51.490
Was I wrong?

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:53.330
No, you weren't.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:54.910
You weren't wrong.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.000
I'm sure she'll understand.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:02.410
I'm sure...

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:15.230
Four hours before Ayase 
Kamiyugi left Sir Garmatha...

